1
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:17,500
♪The Upper Three hold the seals♪

2
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:21,380
♪A valiant general, an opera star, and a ruthless cripple♪

3
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:24,420
♪The Middle Three stir the clouds♪

4
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:29,140
♪A fiend, a wandering hero, and a master of the blade♪

5
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:33,220
♪The Lower Three deal in gold♪

6
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:37,500
♪A beauty, a seer, and a scholar♪

7
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:40,780
♪The Upper, Middle, and Lower Three♪

8
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:49,300
♪Represent the nine houses of old Changsha♪

9
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:51,380
♪Together, they are known♪

10
00:00:52,060 --> 00:00:56,660
♪As the Mystic Nine♪

11
00:01:25,660 --> 00:01:31,900
[Mystic Nine]
[Adapted from the novel of Kennedy Xu]

12
00:01:32,060 --> 00:01:34,980
[Episode 9]
[This story is purely fictional]

13
00:01:37,430 --> 00:01:38,130
I did it.

14
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:05,540
Master.

15
00:02:06,070 --> 00:02:07,820
We've been walking, but we still haven't found Unit 401.

16
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:09,850
Perhaps they never came here?

17
00:02:12,190 --> 00:02:14,410
If only we had Fifth Master's

18
00:02:14,710 --> 00:02:15,690
dogs.

19
00:02:16,750 --> 00:02:18,010
They only obey

20
00:02:18,520 --> 00:02:19,820
their master's command anyway.

21
00:02:22,430 --> 00:02:24,450
What if I start raising one myself?

22
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:25,380
That will work.

23
00:02:25,910 --> 00:02:27,010
Once this is over,

24
00:02:27,630 --> 00:02:28,660
I'll ask him to give me a dog.

25
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:30,850
You might as well change your name.

26
00:02:31,470 --> 00:02:32,290
To what?

27
00:02:32,630 --> 00:02:33,450
Wu Tiezui.

28
00:02:34,870 --> 00:02:35,660
Wu Tiezui?

29
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:37,130
It sounds great.

30
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:40,260
Lucky for me, I just want a pet dog.

31
00:02:42,310 --> 00:02:42,780
Master.

32
00:02:48,870 --> 00:02:49,450
Careful.

33
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:52,220
Close in.

34
00:02:52,240 --> 00:02:52,610
Yes.

35
00:03:05,840 --> 00:03:06,500
Xiaoyu.

36
00:03:07,470 --> 00:03:08,980
Is it Unit 401?

37
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:13,170
Who are you?

38
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:14,820
Tell us your name.

39
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:45,130
Master, it's a dummy.

40
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:49,940
A trap.

41
00:03:50,310 --> 00:03:50,780
Master Zhang.

42
00:03:51,360 --> 00:03:53,100
It doesn't look like the cages are from the Otherworld Tower.

43
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:54,340
They are quite new.

44
00:03:57,910 --> 00:03:59,290
Master, come quick.

45
00:04:01,470 --> 00:04:02,170
Weird.

46
00:04:02,400 --> 00:04:03,610
Why is there a lamp here?

47
00:04:05,750 --> 00:04:07,010
Master, something is written on top.

48
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:14,610
Far East Conquest Medal.

49
00:04:16,120 --> 00:04:16,730
It's the medal

50
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:19,250
for the Japanese who volunteered to work on conquered lands.

51
00:04:20,190 --> 00:04:20,980
A Japanese

52
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:22,490
this deep?

53
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:24,460
Dress his wound.

54
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:25,980
Let's venture deeper.

55
00:04:28,390 --> 00:04:30,250
Things will become more complicated

56
00:04:30,270 --> 00:04:31,140
if the Japanese are involved.

57
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:54,410
Master.

58
00:04:55,190 --> 00:04:56,930
The Japanese set up a defense base here.

59
00:04:57,830 --> 00:04:59,290
It seems like there were a lot of Japanese here.

60
00:05:02,950 --> 00:05:04,660
A crossfire formation.

61
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:07,730
They feared

62
00:05:08,390 --> 00:05:10,020
something in this tower.

63
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:11,850
Is it the shadow?

64
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:14,610
It can't be that simple.

65
00:05:15,310 --> 00:05:17,460
How did they find out about this tower?

66
00:05:18,430 --> 00:05:19,490
And why did they come here?

67
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:23,930
If the Japanese are involved,

68
00:05:24,070 --> 00:05:25,580
this must be a huge conspiracy.

69
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:27,410
The Otherworld Tower is just a small part of it.

70
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:29,250
They must have done much more

71
00:05:29,270 --> 00:05:30,370
than we know so far.

72
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:33,170
Let's not dally.

73
00:05:39,940 --> 00:05:46,140
[Xie's Residence]

74
00:05:50,060 --> 00:05:53,060
[Xie's Residence]

75
00:05:55,500 --> 00:05:57,540
[Xie's Residence]

76
00:06:04,980 --> 00:06:07,660
[Xie Jiu, Xie Clan of the Mystic Nine]

77
00:06:15,870 --> 00:06:17,610
The game is doomed.

78
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:19,660
There's no point in trying.

79
00:06:24,390 --> 00:06:25,490
A pawn

80
00:06:26,830 --> 00:06:28,290
can turn the game around.

81
00:06:30,510 --> 00:06:31,900
Oh, Xie Jiu.

82
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:34,980
As stubborn as ever.

83
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:38,220
But this time,

84
00:06:39,190 --> 00:06:41,220
despite taking everything into account,

85
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:44,170
you won't be able to protect yourself.

86
00:06:48,080 --> 00:06:50,020
Information about you studying in Japan

87
00:06:50,630 --> 00:06:52,020
has reached the Ministry of War today.

88
00:06:53,500 --> 00:06:55,380
[Xie Jiu's Academic Information]

89
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,200
Less than 10,000 people

90
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:04,490
went to Japan to study during this period.

91
00:07:05,270 --> 00:07:08,780
You think they are all Japanese sympathizers?

92
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:11,660
Unlike you, those students

93
00:07:12,480 --> 00:07:14,730
are not close to Kinoshita.

94
00:07:17,070 --> 00:07:18,980
Kinoshita and I are just friends.

95
00:07:19,390 --> 00:07:20,540
Just friends?

96
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:22,980
He is the head

97
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:24,610
of the Chamber of Commerce in Japan.

98
00:07:25,190 --> 00:07:27,170
Three years ago, a letter from you

99
00:07:27,360 --> 00:07:29,520
convinced him to withdraw funds immediately,

100
00:07:29,520 --> 00:07:31,580
causing the Japanese to suffer a loss after a failed investment

101
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:33,170
in Xinyue Restaurant.

102
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:39,370
Kinoshita was my classmate.

103
00:07:40,120 --> 00:07:43,700
When I was studying, my mentor prejudiced against me.

104
00:07:44,630 --> 00:07:45,710
He helped me

105
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:46,660
to graduate successfully.

106
00:07:47,430 --> 00:07:48,730
I owed him a favor.

107
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:50,370
That letter

108
00:07:52,270 --> 00:07:54,020
was to return him the favor.

109
00:07:54,950 --> 00:07:55,930
Return him the favor?

110
00:07:57,070 --> 00:07:57,930
So you admit

111
00:07:58,000 --> 00:07:59,730
that you have dealings with the Japan Chamber of Commerce.

112
00:08:00,630 --> 00:08:01,880
No wonder you have been able to sell your goods

113
00:08:01,880 --> 00:08:02,900
in Japan all these years,

114
00:08:02,900 --> 00:08:04,700
making your business prosperous.

115
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:07,020
If you have proof,

116
00:08:07,390 --> 00:08:08,140
you can arrest me.

117
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:14,340
Xie Jiu.

118
00:08:15,920 --> 00:08:16,980
I am from the Huo Clan.

119
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:19,410
I'm also part of the Mystic Nine.

120
00:08:20,870 --> 00:08:21,930
If I had a choice,

121
00:08:21,950 --> 00:08:23,290
I would never want to hurt you.

122
00:08:31,340 --> 00:08:32,620
[Confession Letter]

123
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:37,300
Sign it.

124
00:08:38,080 --> 00:08:40,100
Hand over the money you earned by working with the Japanese.

125
00:08:40,550 --> 00:08:41,580
I can make sure you're safe.

126
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:44,010
Knowing your talent,

127
00:08:44,240 --> 00:08:46,370
I'm sure you can change your name and make a comeback in a few years.

128
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:53,770
Xie is my ancestral name.

129
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:56,250
I will not change it.

130
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:06,180
Who would have known

131
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:10,650
that you would be willing to die for your family name?

132
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,770
Should I say you're smart

133
00:09:16,150 --> 00:09:17,060
or dumb?

134
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:27,100
I heard an agent from the Japanese Home Ministry

135
00:09:27,150 --> 00:09:29,420
was killed while infiltrating Changsha.

136
00:09:29,790 --> 00:09:31,890
They sure are interested in this place.

137
00:09:32,870 --> 00:09:33,770
To avoid any allegations,

138
00:09:34,360 --> 00:09:35,890
you should just stay here.

139
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:25,530
A Japanese flag?

140
00:10:42,340 --> 00:10:44,660
[Type 89 Grenade Discharger]

141
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:12,820
Master!

142
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:43,530
Master.

143
00:11:44,510 --> 00:11:45,300
They were Japanese soldiers.

144
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:47,220
They all committed seppuku.

145
00:11:52,550 --> 00:11:53,700
They killed themselves.

146
00:12:11,480 --> 00:12:12,100
Master Zhang.

147
00:12:12,910 --> 00:12:13,820
This is odd.

148
00:12:14,790 --> 00:12:17,300
The Japanese soldiers were studying the Otherworld Tower.

149
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:19,730
How come they committed suicide

150
00:12:19,960 --> 00:12:21,580
all of a sudden?

151
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:24,890
There are many supplies here.

152
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:26,650
They could have lived here.

153
00:12:29,550 --> 00:12:31,010
Perhaps they were stuck here for too long.

154
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:32,850
And they knew they couldn't leave this place.

155
00:12:33,790 --> 00:12:35,980
It's possible for them to kill themselves out of despair.

156
00:12:36,670 --> 00:12:38,250
Someone who has lost all hope

157
00:12:38,670 --> 00:12:40,980
would never live in this organized manner.

158
00:12:41,630 --> 00:12:42,340
Besides,

159
00:12:42,790 --> 00:12:43,700
there were many people.

160
00:12:44,790 --> 00:12:47,250
Did they feel despair and commit suicide together?

161
00:12:48,150 --> 00:12:49,610
It doesn't make sense.

162
00:12:55,320 --> 00:12:57,340
I'm familiar with the models here.

163
00:12:57,910 --> 00:12:59,250
Check every corner.

164
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:02,610
I'm sure we'll find something.

165
00:13:10,480 --> 00:13:11,420
Master, look.

166
00:13:16,860 --> 00:13:18,580
[Top Secret]

167
00:13:19,630 --> 00:13:20,980
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama?

168
00:13:23,540 --> 00:13:24,640
Who is Yoshiyuki Hatoyama?

169
00:13:25,230 --> 00:13:26,040
You weren't there.

170
00:13:26,060 --> 00:13:27,010
Of course, you don't know.

171
00:13:27,300 --> 00:13:28,210
We know him quite well.

172
00:13:28,630 --> 00:13:30,490
No wonder Master Zhang finds this place familiar.

173
00:13:30,820 --> 00:13:32,520
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama was a Japanese explorer.

174
00:13:33,030 --> 00:13:35,110
Do you know that Japanese spies infiltrated Changsha

175
00:13:35,110 --> 00:13:35,970
to look for a copper meteor?

176
00:13:36,870 --> 00:13:37,610
Master has told us, yes.

177
00:13:39,110 --> 00:13:40,760
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama was a cautious man.

178
00:13:41,630 --> 00:13:43,920
Why didn't he burn the letter?

179
00:13:44,700 --> 00:13:45,730
There are many supplies here.

180
00:13:45,940 --> 00:13:47,090
All documents are intact.

181
00:13:47,390 --> 00:13:48,090
It doesn't make sense.

182
00:13:49,060 --> 00:13:50,210
So I don't think these soldiers

183
00:13:50,230 --> 00:13:51,130
killed themselves.

184
00:13:51,420 --> 00:13:52,890
They were hallucinating.

185
00:13:53,110 --> 00:13:55,010
So they didn't have the chance to destroy the documents.

186
00:13:55,700 --> 00:13:57,610
Master Zhang must have already come to this conclusion.

187
00:13:57,870 --> 00:13:59,400
Unlike you, who demanded an explanation from me.

188
00:14:01,150 --> 00:14:01,760
And this...

189
00:14:01,780 --> 00:14:02,440
Are you done?

190
00:14:05,630 --> 00:14:06,850
Yes.

191
00:14:10,180 --> 00:14:10,680
Master Zhang.

192
00:14:10,910 --> 00:14:11,800
It's in Japanese.

193
00:14:16,940 --> 00:14:17,970
Stinky Yu?

194
00:14:18,700 --> 00:14:19,890
When did he learn Japanese?

195
00:14:22,030 --> 00:14:23,890
The Japanese have become more active lately.

196
00:14:25,350 --> 00:14:26,730
Master sent him away to learn Japanese

197
00:14:27,300 --> 00:14:29,760
just

198
00:14:30,420 --> 00:14:31,330
in case.

199
00:14:35,300 --> 00:14:35,730
Master.

200
00:14:36,150 --> 00:14:37,640
This is the addendum to the Hatoyama Report.

201
00:14:41,030 --> 00:14:42,560
This is the First Draft of the Hatoyama Report

202
00:14:42,700 --> 00:14:43,890
that Hatoyama submitted to the Japanese Ministry

203
00:14:44,030 --> 00:14:44,800
of Foreign Affairs.

204
00:14:45,390 --> 00:14:46,560
More than 30 years ago,

205
00:14:46,940 --> 00:14:48,370
Otani Kozui

206
00:14:48,750 --> 00:14:50,330
[Yoshiyuki Hatoyama]
went on an expedition in Central Asia.

207
00:14:50,780 --> 00:14:52,920
He brought many laborers and students

208
00:14:53,060 --> 00:14:54,920
into China.

209
00:14:56,460 --> 00:14:57,040
Five years ago,

210
00:14:57,780 --> 00:14:58,800
as he passed by Changsha,

211
00:14:59,180 --> 00:15:00,330
a subdivision of his expedition team,

212
00:15:00,460 --> 00:15:01,890
led by Japanese entrepreneur and explorer,

213
00:15:01,910 --> 00:15:02,920
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama,

214
00:15:03,350 --> 00:15:04,160
stayed nearly three months

215
00:15:04,180 --> 00:15:05,890
in a town 160km north

216
00:15:06,350 --> 00:15:07,890
to Changsha City.

217
00:15:17,300 --> 00:15:17,920
A week later,

218
00:15:18,300 --> 00:15:19,040
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama

219
00:15:19,060 --> 00:15:21,330
submitted a 16-page report to the Japanese Ministry of Foreign Affairs

220
00:15:21,750 --> 00:15:23,330
through the Research Institute for Sino-Japan Trade.

221
00:15:23,700 --> 00:15:25,160
This report is called the Hatoyama Report.

222
00:15:26,750 --> 00:15:27,890
In the report, he claimed

223
00:15:28,180 --> 00:15:29,280
that there was something

224
00:15:29,540 --> 00:15:30,520
beneath Changsha.

225
00:15:31,510 --> 00:15:33,400
It was the copper meteor Master found.

226
00:15:35,990 --> 00:15:36,970
Everyone thought

227
00:15:37,180 --> 00:15:39,280
that everything would be over after the meteor was found.

228
00:15:39,940 --> 00:15:40,400
But in fact,

229
00:15:40,420 --> 00:15:42,250
[Hatoyama Report, Addendum]
there was an addendum.

230
00:15:43,030 --> 00:15:44,560
The confidentiality of this addendum

231
00:15:44,870 --> 00:15:46,250
was even higher than that

232
00:15:46,270 --> 00:15:46,890
of the Hatoyama Report.

233
00:15:47,660 --> 00:15:48,680
It claimed

234
00:15:48,990 --> 00:15:50,440
that somewhere underneath Changsha

235
00:15:50,910 --> 00:15:52,490
housed something more important

236
00:15:52,510 --> 00:15:53,520
than the copper meteor.

237
00:15:54,460 --> 00:15:56,560
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama suggested that they should give up on the meteor

238
00:15:56,990 --> 00:15:58,090
and focus their effort on finding this treasure.

239
00:16:10,460 --> 00:16:10,970
Sir.

240
00:16:11,750 --> 00:16:12,890
How much is this jade fish?

241
00:16:13,270 --> 00:16:14,040
Which one do you like?

242
00:16:14,060 --> 00:16:14,800
Allow me to tell you more about it.

243
00:16:16,780 --> 00:16:18,130
They must be here already.

244
00:16:18,420 --> 00:16:20,330
Come. Let's group up with them.

245
00:16:22,150 --> 00:16:23,760
It seems like the Japanese prioritized the tower

246
00:16:24,660 --> 00:16:26,160
more than the meteor.

247
00:16:29,550 --> 00:16:31,160
Is Yoshiyuki Hatoyama among the soldiers

248
00:16:32,460 --> 00:16:33,610
who killed themselves?

249
00:16:37,660 --> 00:16:39,050
Judging from their uniforms,

250
00:16:40,020 --> 00:16:40,920
they were common soldiers.

251
00:16:41,630 --> 00:16:42,960
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama wasn't here.

252
00:16:43,250 --> 00:16:46,690
[The Eve of Entry]

253
00:16:48,870 --> 00:16:49,640
Master, look.

254
00:16:50,260 --> 00:16:51,610
Their group photo before they came to China.

255
00:16:53,070 --> 00:16:54,530
The number does not match.

256
00:16:55,220 --> 00:16:56,850
At least half of the men are not here.

257
00:16:58,110 --> 00:16:58,610
Master Zhang.

258
00:17:00,180 --> 00:17:01,090
If that's the case,

259
00:17:01,940 --> 00:17:04,240
Yoshiyuki Hatoyama must be deeper

260
00:17:04,700 --> 00:17:05,680
inside this tower.

261
00:17:05,980 --> 00:17:06,440
Master.

262
00:17:06,980 --> 00:17:08,090
I found some journals.

263
00:17:08,610 --> 00:17:10,290
[Journals]

264
00:17:10,980 --> 00:17:12,370
So many documents are still intact.

265
00:17:13,500 --> 00:17:14,400
There is another possibility.

266
00:17:15,460 --> 00:17:16,920
They believed that once they came here,

267
00:17:18,390 --> 00:17:20,290
they couldn't leave anymore.

268
00:17:32,660 --> 00:17:33,290
Master!

269
00:17:34,790 --> 00:17:35,290
Master!

270
00:17:36,740 --> 00:17:37,770
I'm so glad you're safe.

271
00:17:38,310 --> 00:17:39,440
We were worried sick.

272
00:17:40,630 --> 00:17:41,160
Master.

273
00:17:43,390 --> 00:17:43,850
Master?

274
00:17:54,420 --> 00:17:55,330
What's the matter, Master?

275
00:17:56,260 --> 00:17:56,890
Juanlian.

276
00:17:58,550 --> 00:17:59,480
Are you hurt?

277
00:18:00,500 --> 00:18:01,370
No.

278
00:18:02,940 --> 00:18:03,810
Are you sure?

279
00:18:04,630 --> 00:18:05,200
Yes.

280
00:18:08,260 --> 00:18:09,240
Do you remember

281
00:18:09,740 --> 00:18:10,610
what happened just now?

282
00:18:11,980 --> 00:18:12,530
Yes.

283
00:18:14,220 --> 00:18:15,160
We received

284
00:18:15,180 --> 00:18:16,440
the drawing you asked Tu to deliver.

285
00:18:17,220 --> 00:18:18,720
We followed your instructions in the letter

286
00:18:19,350 --> 00:18:19,960
and

287
00:18:20,630 --> 00:18:22,440
we teleported here.

288
00:18:24,940 --> 00:18:25,850
What's wrong, Master?

289
00:18:30,350 --> 00:18:30,890
Master!

290
00:18:30,890 --> 00:18:31,570
Master!

291
00:18:32,590 --> 00:18:33,440
Master!

292
00:18:38,910 --> 00:18:39,440
Heifeng.

293
00:18:41,260 --> 00:18:41,850
Aolie.

294
00:18:42,740 --> 00:18:43,920
Where were you, Master?

295
00:18:44,220 --> 00:18:45,110
We were so worried.

296
00:18:45,110 --> 00:18:47,130
I knew you'd be safe, Master.

297
00:18:52,910 --> 00:18:53,400
Laogou.

298
00:19:00,310 --> 00:19:00,890
Laogou.

299
00:19:09,940 --> 00:19:10,480
Xiangu.

300
00:19:32,460 --> 00:19:32,960
Laogou.

301
00:19:41,980 --> 00:19:42,480
Laogou.

302
00:19:53,220 --> 00:19:53,850
Laogou.

303
00:19:54,550 --> 00:19:56,050
Did something happen to you just now?

304
00:19:57,570 --> 00:20:02,730
♪Your beauty resembles a pristine portrait♪

305
00:20:03,130 --> 00:20:08,090
♪When will the white horse return? I keep thinking about you♪

306
00:20:10,980 --> 00:20:11,480
Xiangu.

307
00:20:14,110 --> 00:20:14,850
When we're out,

308
00:20:16,740 --> 00:20:17,610
let's get married.

309
00:20:20,980 --> 00:20:21,770
What?

310
00:20:25,220 --> 00:20:25,960
Listen to me.

311
00:20:27,110 --> 00:20:28,960
Your clan thinks you're an eyesore.

312
00:20:29,700 --> 00:20:31,370
Ding Qiansui only makes things difficult for you.

313
00:20:32,660 --> 00:20:34,160
Even though you are the head of your clan,

314
00:20:35,500 --> 00:20:36,850
things must have been quite tough for you.

315
00:20:40,460 --> 00:20:41,160
Join my clan.

316
00:20:42,550 --> 00:20:43,290
Just join my clan.

317
00:20:44,220 --> 00:20:45,160
You can lead people.

318
00:20:45,550 --> 00:20:46,530
You'll still be in the Mystic Nine.

319
00:20:46,740 --> 00:20:47,610
Nothing will change.

320
00:20:48,460 --> 00:20:49,680
But I'll be there to protect you.

321
00:20:51,020 --> 00:20:52,370
You will not endure any hardship.

322
00:20:53,810 --> 00:20:59,410
♪Even after a few cycles of time♪

323
00:20:59,890 --> 00:21:05,690
♪I wish my heart still lights up the way when we first met♪

324
00:21:09,660 --> 00:21:10,160
Xiangu.

325
00:21:12,090 --> 00:21:17,410
♪Don't wait until your life becomes full of regrets♪

326
00:21:20,660 --> 00:21:22,240
Did something happen to you just now as well?

327
00:21:23,790 --> 00:21:25,160
I think I had a dream.

328
00:21:27,590 --> 00:21:29,240
I dreamed that in my past life,

329
00:21:30,420 --> 00:21:31,890
I was the owner of an embroidery workshop.

330
00:21:32,910 --> 00:21:33,640
In my dream,

331
00:21:34,550 --> 00:21:35,400
I saw my sister

332
00:21:37,310 --> 00:21:38,200
and my aunt.

333
00:21:41,610 --> 00:21:45,370
♪We first met♪

334
00:21:48,180 --> 00:21:50,090
This must be the tower's doing.

335
00:22:04,590 --> 00:22:05,570
Tell me more.

336
00:22:23,980 --> 00:22:25,400
We still don't know

337
00:22:26,310 --> 00:22:27,920
what is going on right now.

338
00:22:30,350 --> 00:22:30,920
Let's

339
00:22:32,910 --> 00:22:34,130
focus on what we need to do first.

340
00:22:35,830 --> 00:22:36,480
Okay?

341
00:22:41,660 --> 00:22:43,960
Master, the Zhang Clan is not here at all.

342
00:22:44,220 --> 00:22:45,480
Should we whistle to signal them?

343
00:22:47,910 --> 00:22:48,720
Don't wait for them.

344
00:22:49,460 --> 00:22:51,330
Save Tianpeng and Runty first.

345
00:23:12,740 --> 00:23:13,530
Master!

346
00:23:14,590 --> 00:23:16,160
We're stuck here!

347
00:23:17,220 --> 00:23:19,200
Master, it is Tianpeng and the rest.

348
00:23:20,460 --> 00:23:22,090
Be careful of the traps!

349
00:23:23,180 --> 00:23:23,810
Split and search.

350
00:23:55,420 --> 00:23:56,400
This is a yin-yang lock.

351
00:23:57,070 --> 00:23:58,130
The yang catch is here.

352
00:23:58,590 --> 00:23:59,610
The yin catch is somewhere else.

353
00:24:00,830 --> 00:24:02,570
We need to operate them at the same time to solve it.

354
00:24:08,260 --> 00:24:08,960
This time,

355
00:24:10,910 --> 00:24:12,050
I'll solve it correctly.

356
00:24:15,220 --> 00:24:16,090
I'll find the yin catch.

357
00:24:16,660 --> 00:24:17,480
Two of you will stay here.

358
00:24:18,660 --> 00:24:19,290
Remember.

359
00:24:20,390 --> 00:24:23,290
The solution is left three, right two,

360
00:24:24,310 --> 00:24:25,160
left one, right three,

361
00:24:25,830 --> 00:24:27,440
left four, left two.

362
00:24:28,310 --> 00:24:28,770
No matter

363
00:24:29,310 --> 00:24:30,440
what you hear later,

364
00:24:30,940 --> 00:24:31,440
you must

365
00:24:31,460 --> 00:24:32,850
follow the solution I just gave you.

366
00:24:33,420 --> 00:24:34,480
Especially the last step.

367
00:24:35,310 --> 00:24:36,530
Two clicks to the left.

368
00:24:37,870 --> 00:24:38,810
Do not mess this up.

369
00:24:39,660 --> 00:24:40,090
Yes.

370
00:24:45,110 --> 00:24:45,610
Laogou.

371
00:24:46,630 --> 00:24:47,610
You're hiding something from us.

372
00:24:52,700 --> 00:24:53,160
Yes.

373
00:24:56,180 --> 00:24:57,370
But it's not a big deal.

374
00:24:58,910 --> 00:24:59,530
Just trust me.

375
00:25:00,700 --> 00:25:01,850
We have to get out of here alive.

376
00:25:02,940 --> 00:25:05,850
Once we're out, I'll tell you everything.

377
00:25:07,070 --> 00:25:07,610
Okay?

378
00:25:14,390 --> 00:25:16,770
Juanlian, Xiangu, you two solve the puzzle.

379
00:25:17,390 --> 00:25:18,160
Heifeng, Aolie.

380
00:25:18,660 --> 00:25:19,610
Stay in the corridor.

381
00:25:19,630 --> 00:25:20,090
Yes!

382
00:25:36,390 --> 00:25:36,890
Get in position.

383
00:25:37,910 --> 00:25:38,440
Now.

384
00:25:41,870 --> 00:25:42,720
Everything is in order.

385
00:25:53,420 --> 00:25:54,000
Left three.

386
00:25:56,700 --> 00:25:57,240
Left three.

387
00:26:04,390 --> 00:26:05,000
Right two.

388
00:26:06,740 --> 00:26:07,240
Right two.

389
00:26:12,500 --> 00:26:13,160
Left one.

390
00:26:13,870 --> 00:26:14,370
Left one.

391
00:26:16,740 --> 00:26:17,330
Right three.

392
00:26:18,700 --> 00:26:19,160
Right two.

393
00:26:20,420 --> 00:26:20,890
Right two.

394
00:26:23,220 --> 00:26:23,770
Right three.

395
00:26:33,350 --> 00:26:34,050
Left four.

396
00:26:42,460 --> 00:26:43,200
Right three?

397
00:26:48,080 --> 00:26:49,130
Shoot!

398
00:26:50,070 --> 00:26:51,050
It made one more noise.

399
00:26:55,700 --> 00:26:57,200
Did I mishear Master?

400
00:26:57,740 --> 00:26:59,640
How come it's right three?

401
00:27:00,260 --> 00:27:01,050
It should be...

402
00:27:01,590 --> 00:27:02,370
Right three!

403
00:27:03,110 --> 00:27:04,810
Turn it! Now!

404
00:27:12,590 --> 00:27:14,380
Juanlian, the tower is deceiving you!

405
00:27:14,830 --> 00:27:15,680
Don't turn it!

406
00:27:16,590 --> 00:27:18,670
Juanlian, don't dally.

407
00:27:18,830 --> 00:27:20,530
Turn it now!

408
00:27:24,420 --> 00:27:24,960
What are you doing?

409
00:27:27,020 --> 00:27:28,440
You turned it four times. That was wrong.

410
00:27:28,870 --> 00:27:30,720
Master said right three.

411
00:27:49,390 --> 00:27:49,890
Laogou.

412
00:27:50,740 --> 00:27:51,370
Are you all right?

413
00:27:59,940 --> 00:28:00,530
I'm fine.

414
00:28:04,460 --> 00:28:05,160
Just wait for me.

415
00:28:05,700 --> 00:28:06,570
I'll be back soon.

416
00:28:32,630 --> 00:28:34,400
Tianpeng. Zhenyuan.

417
00:28:47,790 --> 00:28:48,240
Xiangu.

418
00:28:48,940 --> 00:28:49,610
Are you okay?

419
00:28:50,020 --> 00:28:50,530
Are you hurt?

420
00:28:50,790 --> 00:28:51,330
I'm fine.

421
00:28:51,790 --> 00:28:53,400
Unfortunately, the shadow escaped.

422
00:28:58,700 --> 00:28:59,370
Thank goodness.

423
00:28:59,700 --> 00:29:00,200
How are you?

424
00:29:02,590 --> 00:29:03,160
Tianpeng.

425
00:29:04,590 --> 00:29:06,440
Wake up, Tianpeng.

426
00:29:08,500 --> 00:29:08,960
Zhenyuan.

427
00:29:09,700 --> 00:29:11,000
Wake up.

428
00:29:16,630 --> 00:29:17,850
My head hurts.

429
00:29:18,500 --> 00:29:19,000
Are you okay?

430
00:29:21,220 --> 00:29:21,680
Zhenyuan.

431
00:29:25,390 --> 00:29:25,890
Master.

432
00:29:29,910 --> 00:29:30,960
I'm so glad everyone is fine.

433
00:29:32,700 --> 00:29:33,720
I'm so glad everyone is fine.

434
00:29:38,110 --> 00:29:38,680
Master.

435
00:30:00,180 --> 00:30:00,680
Master,

436
00:30:01,500 --> 00:30:02,240
I'll read

437
00:30:02,550 --> 00:30:04,240
Jun Tanaka's journal in chronological

438
00:30:04,390 --> 00:30:05,050
order.

439
00:30:05,500 --> 00:30:06,480
April 15th.

440
00:30:07,110 --> 00:30:08,000
Our team

441
00:30:08,740 --> 00:30:09,810
of 54 men

442
00:30:10,590 --> 00:30:12,160
were led by Colonel Hatoyama

443
00:30:12,700 --> 00:30:13,960
into the Otherworld Tower.

444
00:30:31,910 --> 00:30:33,640
Colonel Hatoyama said

445
00:30:34,260 --> 00:30:36,890
that we needed to find a hidden treasure

446
00:30:37,180 --> 00:30:38,850
deep inside the Otherworld Tower.

447
00:30:39,660 --> 00:30:41,090
He said it could change the future,

448
00:30:41,910 --> 00:30:42,400
but he

449
00:30:42,940 --> 00:30:46,610
refused to tell us more.

450
00:30:50,220 --> 00:30:51,000
May 3rd.

451
00:30:52,660 --> 00:30:53,680
We spent two weeks

452
00:30:54,460 --> 00:30:58,000
lost in this maze.

453
00:31:06,630 --> 00:31:07,610
Meanwhile,

454
00:31:07,820 --> 00:31:09,770
Zhang Qishan took over the Mystic Nine

455
00:31:10,460 --> 00:31:11,920
and cleared out all our spies in Changsha.

456
00:31:12,420 --> 00:31:14,160
All our informants in Changsha

457
00:31:14,390 --> 00:31:17,130
were killed by the Mystic Nine.

458
00:31:17,740 --> 00:31:18,810
May 20th.

459
00:31:19,460 --> 00:31:21,960
We are still lost in this maze.

460
00:31:22,590 --> 00:31:24,530
Our stamina is at our limit.

461
00:31:25,790 --> 00:31:27,770
The Otherworld Tower is eerie.

462
00:31:27,910 --> 00:31:29,050
But to our surprise,

463
00:31:29,790 --> 00:31:31,160
something even more unsettling

464
00:31:31,180 --> 00:31:32,160
took place.

465
00:31:34,570 --> 00:31:36,370
[Jun Tanaka]

466
00:31:36,660 --> 00:31:38,530
A squad of eight men vanished.

467
00:31:39,390 --> 00:31:42,200
They were just right in front of us,

468
00:31:42,660 --> 00:31:44,130
but no matter how fast we ran,

469
00:31:44,590 --> 00:31:46,050
we couldn't catch up to them.

470
00:31:47,220 --> 00:31:49,160
We've tried many ways.

471
00:31:49,940 --> 00:31:51,000
In the end,

472
00:31:51,310 --> 00:31:52,850
we can confirm that they always maintain

473
00:31:53,070 --> 00:31:54,640
a distance of 800m from us.

474
00:31:57,790 --> 00:31:59,090
So this is our distance?

475
00:31:59,500 --> 00:32:06,530
Perhaps we're supposed to defy logic.

476
00:32:31,350 --> 00:32:32,570
We found out why

477
00:32:32,910 --> 00:32:34,200
we could never catch up to them.

478
00:32:35,150 --> 00:32:37,720
It seems like

479
00:32:38,260 --> 00:32:39,680
something not belonging to this world

480
00:32:40,150 --> 00:32:41,610
was among the squad.

481
00:32:45,350 --> 00:32:45,810
Master.

482
00:32:46,260 --> 00:32:47,200
This page has been torn as well.

483
00:32:49,110 --> 00:32:50,610
We flipped through the journals.

484
00:32:51,460 --> 00:32:52,890
How come many of them have been torn off?

485
00:32:56,220 --> 00:32:56,770
Carry on.

486
00:32:58,350 --> 00:32:59,440
October 27th.

487
00:33:01,150 --> 00:33:03,050
We have spent too long underground.

488
00:33:04,940 --> 00:33:06,050
I long to see the sunlight.

489
00:33:06,980 --> 00:33:09,640
We will soon finish the core mission

490
00:33:10,150 --> 00:33:14,330
of this secret report with Colonel Hatoyama.

491
00:33:15,020 --> 00:33:16,200
But

492
00:33:16,830 --> 00:33:18,160
we're almost out of food.

493
00:33:18,390 --> 00:33:21,420
The colonel asked us to stay here.

494
00:33:21,420 --> 00:33:22,610
We cannot leave.

495
00:33:23,790 --> 00:33:26,810
But he keeps going out alone.

496
00:33:27,180 --> 00:33:28,960
I don't know where he goes.

497
00:33:31,590 --> 00:33:35,040
The hunger is slowly eroding our sanity.

498
00:33:35,580 --> 00:33:36,810
Some even fell down

499
00:33:38,310 --> 00:33:39,920
and never woke up again.

500
00:33:43,710 --> 00:33:45,770
When I was about to give up hope,

501
00:33:46,580 --> 00:33:48,920
Colonel Hatoyama gave me a map

502
00:33:49,940 --> 00:33:51,400
and asked me to go to a place.

503
00:34:00,580 --> 00:34:03,210
Someone above dropped us supplies regularly.

504
00:34:03,830 --> 00:34:04,960
There were some letters too.

505
00:34:05,190 --> 00:34:06,960
It seems like the colonel

506
00:34:08,020 --> 00:34:08,920
found a way to contact the outside world

507
00:34:09,060 --> 00:34:10,670
and get us supplies.

508
00:34:10,670 --> 00:34:11,210
Yes!

509
00:34:11,390 --> 00:34:13,850
But how did he do it?

510
00:34:16,870 --> 00:34:18,080
November 8th.

511
00:34:18,870 --> 00:34:22,730
Colonel Hatoyama said he would venture deeper.

512
00:34:23,310 --> 00:34:24,480
He said he had figured out

513
00:34:24,500 --> 00:34:25,600
this mysterious place.

514
00:34:30,980 --> 00:34:32,810
He told us to stay here

515
00:34:33,390 --> 00:34:38,920
as he brought another troop deeper.

516
00:34:40,580 --> 00:34:41,370
After this entry,

517
00:34:41,670 --> 00:34:43,770
it's only just the daily lives of the Japanese soldiers who stayed.

518
00:34:45,540 --> 00:34:46,370
And in the end,

519
00:34:47,910 --> 00:34:48,690
Jun Tanaka

520
00:34:50,390 --> 00:34:51,650
received a telegram.

521
00:35:04,310 --> 00:35:07,850
Colonel Hatoyama issued the last order.

522
00:35:08,350 --> 00:35:08,890
My comrades,

523
00:35:10,140 --> 00:35:11,730
the mission is in its final phase.

524
00:35:12,790 --> 00:35:14,000
For the honor of Imperial Japan

525
00:35:14,420 --> 00:35:15,920
and His Majesty,

526
00:35:17,100 --> 00:35:19,890
commit seppuku to display your loyalty.

527
00:35:21,270 --> 00:35:23,040
The highest calling will be achieved,

528
00:35:24,190 --> 00:35:24,890
and we

529
00:35:25,910 --> 00:35:27,330
will meet again.

530
00:35:58,310 --> 00:35:59,480
According to the journals,

531
00:36:00,390 --> 00:36:03,330
they descended through this well.

532
00:36:07,190 --> 00:36:09,120
What is down there?

533
00:36:10,310 --> 00:36:10,770
Master Zhang,

534
00:36:11,500 --> 00:36:12,890
didn't Hatoyama say

535
00:36:13,100 --> 00:36:14,080
he had already

536
00:36:14,100 --> 00:36:15,210
figured this place out?

537
00:36:15,830 --> 00:36:17,210
Why did he send a telegram

538
00:36:17,870 --> 00:36:20,250
and ask them to commit suicide?

539
00:36:23,830 --> 00:36:26,850
If the people who were supposed to support them committed suicide,

540
00:36:28,230 --> 00:36:29,480
does it mean

541
00:36:30,230 --> 00:36:31,690
that the troop who went down with him

542
00:36:32,140 --> 00:36:33,520
had also committed suicide?

543
00:36:35,710 --> 00:36:39,080
Asking everyone to commit suicide with just a telegram

544
00:36:39,500 --> 00:36:40,730
is normal for them.

545
00:36:42,540 --> 00:36:44,250
It can make sure

546
00:36:44,270 --> 00:36:45,920
that the secret will stay with them forever.

547
00:36:46,190 --> 00:36:47,250
There's no point in guessing.

548
00:36:49,420 --> 00:36:50,600
Find Hatoyama

549
00:36:52,420 --> 00:36:55,040
and we'll find the answer.

550
00:36:56,460 --> 00:36:59,080
Master Zhang, you sound hesitant.

551
00:37:08,350 --> 00:37:08,850
Xiaojin!

552
00:37:20,390 --> 00:37:20,810
This is...

553
00:37:21,270 --> 00:37:21,690
This is...

554
00:37:22,270 --> 00:37:23,690
Who is sending the telegram?

555
00:37:24,670 --> 00:37:26,770
Could it be Unit 401?

556
00:37:29,270 --> 00:37:29,960
Impossible.

557
00:37:30,910 --> 00:37:31,890
It's a different channel.

558
00:37:32,870 --> 00:37:34,250
Even if Unit 401 was sending a telegram,

559
00:37:35,020 --> 00:37:36,040
they would send it to us.

560
00:37:36,190 --> 00:37:37,250
Why would they send it to the Japanese?

561
00:37:40,060 --> 00:37:40,690
So

562
00:37:42,020 --> 00:37:43,370
the Japanese underground

563
00:37:43,390 --> 00:37:44,650
are writing to us now?

564
00:37:46,580 --> 00:37:47,920
They are still alive?

565
00:38:01,450 --> 00:38:02,210
[It's]

566
00:38:05,170 --> 00:38:06,170
[Extremely]

567
00:38:06,170 --> 00:38:07,050
[Dangerous]

568
00:38:07,050 --> 00:38:07,850
[Please]

569
00:38:07,850 --> 00:38:08,690
[Send]

570
00:38:08,690 --> 00:38:09,650
[Help]

571
00:38:11,710 --> 00:38:12,250
Master.

572
00:38:13,060 --> 00:38:13,600
I have decrypted it.

573
00:38:17,210 --> 00:38:19,410
[It's extremely dangerous. Please send help.]

574
00:38:19,670 --> 00:38:20,920
It's extremely dangerous.

575
00:38:21,980 --> 00:38:23,210
Please send help.

576
00:38:24,670 --> 00:38:26,650
Master, they are asking for help.

577
00:38:36,350 --> 00:38:36,920
Master.

578
00:38:37,580 --> 00:38:39,210
You are my savior.

579
00:38:40,020 --> 00:38:42,250
I could just kowtow to you right now.

580
00:38:46,580 --> 00:38:48,520
What exactly is this place?

581
00:38:48,750 --> 00:38:49,890
I blinked

582
00:38:50,580 --> 00:38:51,850
and suddenly, I'm here.

583
00:38:52,460 --> 00:38:53,210
Exactly, Master.

584
00:38:54,140 --> 00:38:55,400
What is happening?

585
00:38:58,540 --> 00:39:00,650
Master, say something.

586
00:39:04,750 --> 00:39:05,330
Everything is fine.

587
00:39:06,540 --> 00:39:08,000
You were deceived by the shadow.

588
00:39:09,710 --> 00:39:10,600
He brought you here

589
00:39:11,390 --> 00:39:12,120
and imprisoned you.

590
00:39:13,620 --> 00:39:14,440
Are you okay?

591
00:39:15,540 --> 00:39:16,120
I'm fine.

592
00:39:17,310 --> 00:39:17,810
Master.

593
00:39:19,620 --> 00:39:22,400
The shadow put us through this ordeal.

594
00:39:22,940 --> 00:39:24,370
We cannot just let him walk away freely.

595
00:39:25,190 --> 00:39:27,400
We have to catch him before Zhang Qishan does.

596
00:39:27,620 --> 00:39:28,400
That's right, Master.

597
00:39:28,420 --> 00:39:29,370
Don't let him walk away for free.

598
00:39:29,390 --> 00:39:30,170
- We must catch him. - Master.

599
00:39:40,270 --> 00:39:41,120
All of you are safe.

600
00:39:42,830 --> 00:39:43,690
Now, listen to me.

601
00:39:44,940 --> 00:39:45,440
One.

602
00:39:46,710 --> 00:39:48,080
Forget about Zhang Qishan.

603
00:39:48,540 --> 00:39:50,290
We cannot lose our lives for him here.

604
00:39:51,420 --> 00:39:52,480
We must get out of here alive.

605
00:39:54,140 --> 00:39:54,520
Two.

606
00:39:57,790 --> 00:39:59,440
Both of you almost died just now.

607
00:40:01,140 --> 00:40:02,480
I followed the tower's guidance

608
00:40:04,190 --> 00:40:05,170
and brought you back.

609
00:40:10,310 --> 00:40:11,080
Master,

610
00:40:11,580 --> 00:40:13,290
even if we're dumb, you can't...

611
00:40:13,460 --> 00:40:14,120
Do you trust me?

612
00:40:15,190 --> 00:40:15,680
I...

613
00:40:15,910 --> 00:40:16,400
Master.

614
00:40:16,620 --> 00:40:17,370
Do you trust me or not?

615
00:40:17,980 --> 00:40:18,730
- Yes. - Yes.

616
00:40:18,740 --> 00:40:19,810
- We trust you, Master. - Yes.

617
00:40:23,870 --> 00:40:24,480
Juanlian.

618
00:40:24,870 --> 00:40:25,290
Master.

619
00:40:25,910 --> 00:40:26,770
Pack up.

620
00:40:27,580 --> 00:40:28,370
Get ready to leave.

621
00:40:28,500 --> 00:40:28,920
Yes.

622
00:40:32,750 --> 00:40:33,170
Tianpeng.

623
00:40:33,670 --> 00:40:34,080
Just rest.

624
00:40:34,350 --> 00:40:34,770
Sit down.

625
00:40:38,910 --> 00:40:39,400
Xiangu.

626
00:40:41,100 --> 00:40:41,650
It's time to go.

627
00:40:45,100 --> 00:40:45,560
What?

628
00:40:50,270 --> 00:40:51,920
If you think you're making the right call,

629
00:40:54,940 --> 00:40:56,330
then have faith in yourself.

630
00:41:01,620 --> 00:41:02,690
I believe in you.

631
00:41:07,350 --> 00:41:07,850
Okay.

632
00:41:11,020 --> 00:41:11,600
Don't worry.

633
00:41:15,140 --> 00:41:15,520
Let's go.

634
00:41:19,100 --> 00:41:19,650
Let's go.

635
00:41:20,140 --> 00:41:20,730
Yes.

636
00:42:19,890 --> 00:42:24,050
♪The past fades like smoke♪

637
00:42:24,410 --> 00:42:27,130
♪A choice is made in silence♪

638
00:42:27,410 --> 00:42:30,210
♪In this labyrinthine puzzle♪

639
00:42:30,610 --> 00:42:34,370
♪Who can reach the shore?♪

640
00:42:34,610 --> 00:42:38,050
♪Just an ordinary farewell♪

641
00:42:38,330 --> 00:42:41,730
♪The sun seems to shine bright over our heads♪

642
00:42:41,810 --> 00:42:49,090
♪But this could be our last trip together♪

643
00:42:49,530 --> 00:42:52,810
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

644
00:42:53,090 --> 00:42:56,330
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

645
00:42:56,490 --> 00:43:00,530
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

646
00:43:00,730 --> 00:43:04,090
♪Who believes in fate?♪

647
00:43:04,330 --> 00:43:07,690
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

648
00:43:07,930 --> 00:43:11,210
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

649
00:43:11,530 --> 00:43:15,210
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

650
00:43:15,410 --> 00:43:18,650
♪Take care♪

651
00:43:18,650 --> 00:43:21,210
♪We once raced♪

652
00:43:21,290 --> 00:43:23,210
♪For the dawn♪

653
00:43:23,370 --> 00:43:26,650
♪Ever-lasting bond, a satisfying vindication♪

654
00:43:26,770 --> 00:43:30,050
♪In the web of fate♪

655
00:43:30,050 --> 00:43:33,250
♪No one can escape♪

656
00:43:34,250 --> 00:43:36,090
♪Life and death cut like a blade♪

657
00:43:36,250 --> 00:43:37,810
♪We too were young once♪

658
00:43:37,890 --> 00:43:41,330
♪Fortunate to brave the raging waves together♪

659
00:43:41,530 --> 00:43:43,850
♪Keep the ember lit♪

660
00:43:43,970 --> 00:43:48,490
♪To illuminate the journey ahead♪

661
00:43:48,610 --> 00:43:51,570
♪The spring breeze continues outside♪

662
00:43:51,810 --> 00:43:55,330
♪Who was it who left in such haste?♪

663
00:43:55,450 --> 00:43:59,210
♪Caught in the game, the raging waves fall silent♪

664
00:43:59,530 --> 00:44:03,010
♪Who believes in fate?♪

665
00:44:03,170 --> 00:44:06,170
♪For my home and my country, the years pass like a dream♪

666
00:44:06,410 --> 00:44:10,170
♪When the song ends, who will still be waiting?♪

667
00:44:10,330 --> 00:44:14,050
♪With a nod, we bid farewell and set out again♪

668
00:44:14,170 --> 00:44:25,610
♪Please, do take care of yourself♪

